# W060 — the Blender sidecar adapter's local (pre-registration) link state.
#
# adapters/renderers/blender is a NESTED package path that the frozen
# pnpm-workspace.yaml globs ("adapters/*" and "adapters/renderers/*" — one
# level each) do not match, so until the Tech Lead's registration pass adds
# the adapters/foundations/* + two-level renderer glob entries,
# scripts/link-local.mjs builds a gitignored local node_modules (workspace
# symlinks only — this package has ZERO external dependencies). Blender
# itself is NEVER downloaded or bundled here: operators supply the binary
# (EPOCH_BLENDER_PATH). Post-registration pnpm owns node_modules directly.
node_modules
.local-stage
*.tsbuildinfo
